\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Proposed viability-preserving rollout ADP. The finite candidate-graph state carries current node, covered and selected masks, and remaining budget. The safety shield removes inadmissible SOOAs before search. A depth-$d$ exact prefix is terminated by a complete adaptive safe-greedy simulation; a branch is viable only if this completion reaches the coverage goal. The first minimizing action is executed and the value is recomputed.}}{6}{figure.37}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:adp-architecture}{{2}{6}{Proposed viability-preserving rollout ADP. The finite candidate-graph state carries current node, covered and selected masks, and remaining budget. The safety shield removes inadmissible SOOAs before search. A depth-$d$ exact prefix is terminated by a complete adaptive safe-greedy simulation; a branch is viable only if this completion reaches the coverage goal. The first minimizing action is executed and the value is recomputed}{figure.37}{}}
